    "scenesThatPass": [
      "CATHY: I think they’re at their peak this week-end.\nMARISSA: I can’t go til the end of the month.\nCATHY: That’s too bad. They might be over by then.\nMARISSA: I know. And New York magazine gave a list where they’re the best this year.",
      "KATE: Weirdly hot today, huh?\nREBECCA: I work inside.\nKATE: You had to go outside to get to work. And to leave work, right?\nKATE: How’s your grandmother?",
      "ANDRA: I don’t know why you don’t go to Associated.\nREBECCA: You do know.\nANDRA: If it was your money you’d walk the extra six blocks.\nREBECCA: It’s ten blocks. And no I wouldn’t.",
      "KATE: Why does she hate us so much? What did we do to her?\nABBY: She sees you, she sees death. You’re a vulture.\nKATE: Us buying that apartment has no down side. Her grandmother’s still living there, we’re not hovering. The only difference to her is that now …\nABBY: You’re a saint.",
      "REBECCA: What shall we do for your birthday? Mary and I will take you out.\nANDRA: Mary?\nREBECCA: Sure. She’s just been really busy."
    ]
  },
